sequenceDiagram
    participant SM as scheduler.Main
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant W as Worker
    SM->>S: start(8080)
    Note over S: 监听 TCP，启动每秒一次的故障检测
    Note over W: main 创建 worker-1，调用 start
    W->>W: 先绑定监听端口 9001
    W->>S: REGISTER|worker-1|localhost|9001
    S->>S: 校验参数，workers.putIfAbsent
    alt 新 Worker
        S-->>W: REGISTERED|worker-1
        Note over S: 初始状态 ALIVE，记录当前心跳时间
        W->>W: 启动心跳，再进入 accept 循环
    else ID 已存在
        S-->>W: ALREADY_REGISTERED|worker-1
        W->>W: 注册失败，退出并清理线程池
    else 参数不合法
        S-->>W: ERROR|INVALID_REGISTER 或 INVALID_PORT
        W->>W: 注册失败，退出并清理线程池
    end
